	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 「スター・ウォーズ　エピソード３／シスの復讐」に登場するグリーヴァス将軍を1/12スケールで商品化！",
			"• 通常時の2本腕状態や、戦闘時の4本腕の状態を選択可能。",
			"• ライトセーバー4本を使用した印象的な戦闘スタイルを再現してください！",
			"• インサート成形により複雑な関節部分は最小限のパーツで構成、瞳の色分けも成形色で再現しています。",
			"• 着脱式の不織布マントも付属。",
			"• 全高約180mm"
		],
		"en": [
			"• General Grievous who appears in \"Star Wars Episode III: Revenge of the Sith\" is commercialized in 1/12 Scale!",
			"• You can choose between a normal two-armed state and a four-armed state during battle.",
			"• Recreate an impressive fighting style using 4 lightsabers!",
			"• Complex joints are constructed with a minimum number of parts thanks to insert molding, and the color coding of the eyes is also reproduced using molded colors.",
			"• A detachable non-woven cloak is also included.",
			"• Total height approx. 180mm"
		]
	},
